# "You may cast the exiled card" lets a split card be cast as either half (CR 709.3, 601.3), and "mana of any type can be spent
# to cast that spell" pays for the half cast (CR 609.4b). Null Summoner exiles Bot2's Life // Death, and Bot1, with threshold,
# casts Life ({G}) from exile with Mox Pearl's {W}. Bot1's lands become 1/1 creatures until end of turn; the card, cast from
# exile, goes to its owner's graveyard.

